{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you be the hero for this lone world?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on a journey through a minimalistic low poly world, once so peaceful, that fell into turmoil after the slimes have gone mad. Discover different environments, their inhabitants and secrets, climb the highest mushrooms of the mysterious swamp and fight your way into the depths of the crystal mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/35446a1c135b1ad011f03bb708c5a0e0.poster.avif?t=1759392192\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/35446a1c135b1ad011f03bb708c5a0e0.webm?t=1759392192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/35446a1c135b1ad011f03bb708c5a0e0.mp4?t=1759392192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wand to tackle hordes of slimes and feel the rhythm of battle as the portal opens and waves upon waves of slimes will charge your way. Use your sword to deal with groups of slimes, but wield it with caution, for it strikes slow. Keep track of all enemies around you and keep watch for those that trick your senses. Never rest, never hesitate, for the next wave is coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/1112b144e472f2eefb695fc6f91dd4a6.poster.avif?t=1759392192\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/1112b144e472f2eefb695fc6f91dd4a6.webm?t=1759392192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/1112b144e472f2eefb695fc6f91dd4a6.mp4?t=1759392192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A world full of secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many secrets await, big and small, for the eyes of a watchful hero. Discover all that this realm has to offer and listen to the retro soundtrack of worlds long past. Stare into the dancing flames and watch the sparks rise to the night sky as the mysteries of Slimetopia unfold. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/52c5e966af43b168dc2050b419cd8b1f.poster.avif?t=1759392192\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/52c5e966af43b168dc2050b419cd8b1f.webm?t=1759392192\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/extras/52c5e966af43b168dc2050b419cd8b1f.mp4?t=1759392192\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4052230?t=1759392192","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/971b3d3177b334810c61593635a12e9beeced0de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759392192","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/3dba851a364763f216963076b79593acd52a1de4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759392192","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4052230/